{"channelId":"UCdLb536ht3xSJ6YJ-LF8r3g","row":["Hanoi Pet Adoption",447,"https://hanoipetadoption.com\nEstablished in 2015, we have rescued over 2,000 cases and re-homed hundreds of dogs and cats.\n\n     Hanoi Pet Adoption is a group of Vietnamese volunteers with the support of some international volunteers. Our mission is to provide a no-kill shelter with adequate care and treatment for lost, stray, and abandoned animals that we rescue. \n     Also, we make efforts to increase their adoption opportunities, as well as find permanent, and loving homes for them. \n     Last but not least, we promote responsible pet ownership through education, community outreach, and collaboration while maintaining respect and compassion for animals.\n\n🙏If You Can't Adopt - Get Temporary Care\n🙏If you can't provide temporary care - Please sponsor\n🙏If you can't sponsor - Volunteer\n🙏If you can't volunteer - Please donate\n🙏If you can't donate - Please spread the word\n\n💛 Please Like, Share and Subscribe the channel to help us! 💛","","Vietnam"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdLb536ht3xSJ6YJ-LF8r3g","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdLb536ht3xSJ6YJ-LF8r3g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:34.475Z","channelId":"UCdLb536ht3xSJ6YJ-LF8r3g","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"d8efdf2aeb4c293e52df5bdbe43226b0f122230f346bf4fc82dfdeead43a52e5","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"70a7851da1982b0d5f525777b26b9a84909d203ec2323f75488fb698e44d6a27"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdLb536ht3xSJ6YJ-LF8r3g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:34.475Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdLb536ht3xSJ6YJ-LF8r3g","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":447,"raw":"447 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdLb536ht3xSJ6YJ-LF8r3g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:34.475Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],